      </ul>

      <p>
        <strong>PHV Prep UK is an independent study aid.</strong> It is not
        affiliated with, authorised by, or endorsed by Solihull Metropolitan
        Borough Council or any licensing authority. Always check the council's
        official guidance for the latest test requirements and fees.
      </p>
    </article>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
